#: scenario8:scenario8_6859F8BA_2B60_443D_A146_6359F9BCC8F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e74ce09803a15f80dd5e0fff85e8d641907598def752f50a1442b5ad17196b1
#. default-sha256: 09c5c7c3e381604689cb7c1c839d6c9da6fbf74a8b65c3b57fda47ba96a2c115
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6859F8BA_2B60_443D_A146_6359F9BCC8F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That endless expanse of red earth"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫赤みを帯びた土が永遠に続く姿が――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A4A3F35D_D62F_4F2A_B280_64EB88F05101
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fac47690590bcb1496394b22225f35a59d2ce8be473a117c5c25b9e6dbc5fe5
#. default-sha256: a6a8e8d5d14a0003accb8d9aa65faf7eb2f0f7a83d3c90f44cdb53db95555ade
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A4A3F35D_D62F_4F2A_B280_64EB88F05101"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫remains branded into the very fabric of my mind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫脳裏に焼きついている。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_86014BCE_50E9_48BD_9AD2_C18A9B08E47F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9719ca7c84a0c75697f35d31a52e61a2f41bcf299bba0d1a70dfc96616c8d29a
#. default-sha256: 8730e93c7093bba9632bd36bf99f77f7780c9ed87d9ea2bcd216e190c8ae37bf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_86014BCE_50E9_48BD_9AD2_C18A9B08E47F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That’s where it was decided someone built like I am would be the most use, I suppose."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫俺は頑丈だったからな……、⟪k:1⟫その方が使い勝手が良かったのだろう。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EFE14CCC_A8CF_4BAA_BE17_57EA45F3D07C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09ba036c31dafc922f2dd11780abb399f190bfa49c5b3bcd1d8ddb90b1ce875b
#. default-sha256: 1e0b62cdcb300cfb21f773b6cd25bffa586c78598c345751a6c1f1944a59fb1e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EFE14CCC_A8CF_4BAA_BE17_57EA45F3D07C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I could tell from their tone of voice and expressions that the things they were saying "
"were not friendly. ⟪k:1⟫They seemed to be mocking me, laughing at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし、⟪k:1⟫そいつらが友好的な存在でないことなど、⟪k:2⟫語調や表情を見れば瞭然だ。⟪k:3⟫侮蔑と"
"嘲笑が混じっている……そんな雰囲気でな……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CDC5F7AC_8330_457D_B164_F088B8DEC181
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9a42be0028ee1b36f7201d2f40fa018c3f6497ca9259625ef83f23e110e9ae3
#. default-sha256: 4bb6efab12ef9a0c9c3ad9cd7be43f411bbdfded05530fb2ee4d01f1d67c920d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CDC5F7AC_8330_457D_B164_F088B8DEC181"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As you might expect, I attempted to protest,⟪k:1⟫but evidently, I had been beaten quite "
"badly while I was unconscious."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫当然……俺は抵抗を試みたが、⟪k:1⟫既に十分に痛めつけられていたのか、⟪k:2⟫身体のふしぶしが軋むよ"
"うでうまく身動きが取れず――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_189711F9_D6CC_485D_95C3_728672FF3E07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3b975ea897d26bf9026564d08a01abd6f997935f2a3fcbd92421ddb4dab2dff
#. default-sha256: e824f778f56d0caee0d8ddc4d8c571ba59f5d07f0bb4750203e90a9ddf32d58b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_189711F9_D6CC_485D_95C3_728672FF3E07"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My joints were stiff and swollen, on top of my dehydration,⟪k:1⟫so I could barely move, let "
"alone put up a fight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫碌に水分も摂取出来ていなかったのだろう、⟪k:1⟫乾きがひどく……身体に力が入らなかった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_64D83DD8_B6FF_487B_AA17_AC0B63B424CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 632f0d703585e99f7deb44283d7e48ea49b287448e1c98ce2fb312f4def4221f
#. default-sha256: bc0c2544397b611d83d141ef5ebce506260682e471ff84253b8d52427fd9158e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_64D83DD8_B6FF_487B_AA17_AC0B63B424CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As strong as I might have been at full health, I was in no condition to do anything then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どれほど力に自信があろうとも、⟪k:1⟫そういう状況では何も出来ん。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_475C661B_0BE8_4B09_A455_E9CE8A5CCB88
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 314b95bc30598a36e29f00fbd0064483d3418e34762aec6e77f4f18175a256d1
#. default-sha256: 079c1660575694b8fd80c708442ed544e306caea47b1c322dc0efc9021e392c6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_475C661B_0BE8_4B09_A455_E9CE8A5CCB88"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They had many words to describe me, none of them flattering.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Some of them would "
"even call me “beast.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫奴らは俺を様々な言葉で罵っていた。⟪k:1⟫ああ、⟪k:2⟫獣と呼ばれたこともあったな……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5244F813_E939_4660_BDB7_59797A6E7A7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e84d9f559e548b4feeca323487b38ef55220d4cb64effd1e0d4102ec1460b66
#. default-sha256: c3559ba085b5020b7535c4fedd8d1bd4a21e5b6f090c99f583bf14b9f79c45c3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5244F813_E939_4660_BDB7_59797A6E7A7D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The slave trader’s guards were armed, of course.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Swords hanging from their hips, "
"ready to cut down anyone who showed any sign of resistance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫馬車を見張る奴隷商の護衛は、⟪k:1⟫当然剣を帯びていたし――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫抵抗すれば殺されるのが目に見"
"えている。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_95934EAA_5C56_448B_B646_04C8D400B5E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71c4b73351a7ede4552706e55dec13168ea089cea0161e5eb667f14afa35d8b9
#. default-sha256: 29704d38c9f50e2bde3cd756aa94d268a1e69c97827f58b883d9cffb1a648ed9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_95934EAA_5C56_448B_B646_04C8D400B5E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So they sat there, lamenting their fate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だから……、⟪k:1⟫みな、⟪k:2⟫自分の行く末を嘆き、⟪k:3⟫憂えていた。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_54ADD76B_A412_4AFA_BA50_2C9D1C49BD83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35b6104b60cb79dc3a74f1e80c9e32b8123dde181df03961decdf95d1a3b7c6d
#. default-sha256: c88bef6e30cd5d8d37232fc0a824b1010110e6010a20e1d4ff3fdc0c848500f7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_54ADD76B_A412_4AFA_BA50_2C9D1C49BD83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Glancing over at her, I caught a glimpse of her face—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫large chunks of skin "
"seemed to have fallen off it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫横目でその顔を見たが、⟪k:1⟫奇妙なものだった。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫あれは……皮膚が爛れているというべき"
"か……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3C09BB0D_D06D_4694_AFEE_33B7DB1722FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83ccdc7ae33428198c57f2b055b1fe92fa250a5893bbb27e3a99d0a835c06d7f
#. default-sha256: 4a7a49c5c92a05c0421026b706f09317c584ab22f08cbd6047e4ee3dd1fb7be2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3C09BB0D_D06D_4694_AFEE_33B7DB1722FE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was, suffice it to say, an unusual sight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫醜い顔をしていた。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EA4C890F_1548_4752_A156_2A7C16C62C10
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20285b7d78611613d43ad8a0069a3393b4ea6ed0ba4e383a82447eb9fb92bc46
#. default-sha256: 301434603a4eaeb9bd712a83ca4f113299c6408791da0433a4688d1e074eac48
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EA4C890F_1548_4752_A156_2A7C16C62C10"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m not sure how to describe it... ⟪k:1⟫but it seemed different somehow from everyone else "
"crying in the carriage. It was almost like..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫なんと言えば良いのか……他とは違っているように見えたんだ。⟪k:1⟫泣いている奴などたくさんいたが、"
"⟪k:2⟫あれは、⟪k:3⟫そう――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F2B7BADB_C3EA_40B1_AEE7_6D49DE1D5C3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00d58e47f0b6121bcd1864da8fe05aade9ba304817b410af8479fc83d2ff7940
#. default-sha256: e123fed0861484d1c617ffe4eeab9c2af2ed4fbd04c0786c4b5c0f00c29cc36d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F2B7BADB_C3EA_40B1_AEE7_6D49DE1D5C3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫her tears were not for herself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫自分に対する嘆きではなかった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4121FD91_F6D5_45F3_9CE9_623725AE1CC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ede72b720d475dfe467cabfec1b4b34e08bc266686074c8993351b6cc709f68
#. default-sha256: edc5bd25f268cad43922c5eb45121612a9f4d74fc1e9ac5e136072d6cbfce817
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4121FD91_F6D5_45F3_9CE9_623725AE1CC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why are you crying?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……おまえはなぜ泣いている……？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D6308C27_83A4_4537_B693_124430D2D1DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b4a3020ba727e02ac5b3e05ef56b921b92ff1b3af2618fde3cc46e68d6c3820
#. default-sha256: 292be7f2c07693f8d32b852519668bc5d5e1e01a2399eec5effaba6b33a65ad0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D6308C27_83A4_4537_B693_124430D2D1DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After a moment’s hesitation, she said,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そいつは少しだけためらった後に、⟪k:1⟫こう言った。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8D93A337_D2B1_4263_88A0_79A5D2C433CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4a3771944ac70fad66784166d54f66f2bdb79427e07dd36c7f4a7cc90b3c013
#. default-sha256: 7386b5b77c0443e7a8fb3256e32d7d6e11a6e3e4b2a0aae4391a02b08da90faf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8D93A337_D2B1_4263_88A0_79A5D2C433CA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For a moment, I was filled with a sense of tranquility,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫平穏な風が……少しだけ、⟪k:1⟫俺の心に吹いた。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DD5FAAB1_FB91_428F_A8DF_2C1B7B49DC0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa575c40a56f9d1ee9c60a6b1aa1de2e81f166335b5407a04a510382a122e168
#. default-sha256: 30623e10241b70666e09b64611627d1a7ee9787a82fec513e0741b7766a8943b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DD5FAAB1_FB91_428F_A8DF_2C1B7B49DC0C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and though you may not believe it,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫俺は、⟪k:1⟫その時……、⟪k:2⟫信じてもらえないかもしれないが……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6C1999A0_BBCE_491A_9F11_3AA8BB65B59D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db81833d3739972aca68cefe2e4ed8ecc113ca528015d601af5138b81a003921
#. default-sha256: 8597acdd9e13482e86e6aa7757a290ee19ea10e3947734c786a7c5b83e33b04d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6C1999A0_BBCE_491A_9F11_3AA8BB65B59D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This is no lie, I promise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫嘘では……、⟪k:1⟫ない……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D377934A_089F_403D_A7CE_0876CD37C5EE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9af3bd73ee75b9a66cafe8c422fea454ed3799f4fc020c6a775d57ff38a77f7
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D377934A_089F_403D_A7CE_0876CD37C5EE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C75B6762_6766_41AE_BA3B_52BF6A5BD0F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c67852418d57a91e0ecbd554b9e830de2ba0d6a4aaf07052c89fda0a5458538c
#. default-sha256: 94db0fb647235686b2627145e15993e27d2a3a91d7f705e1cc299383faa4e4a9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C75B6762_6766_41AE_BA3B_52BF6A5BD0F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m begging you!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……頼む……ッ！！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1774CFC9_2512_4570_AE5C_B1ACDF30C87C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 880140243062c225eca8df12c27b94bc9d0329ba605cf263328d81457e48264f
#. default-sha256: 938d691eb94b858e91367fb0b019d2f92253ae077630f28ee9f3db5acbd9ca7d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1774CFC9_2512_4570_AE5C_B1ACDF30C87C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They let their guard down because we were restrained.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The thought of anyone "
"resisting never once crossed their minds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あるいは……枷があるから奴らは油断したのかもしれない。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫まさか逆襲に出る者がいるとは――"
"想像だにしていなかったのだろう。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A91022C2_DDC8_404F_9E06_8CCEBACC812E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3777d502ba0f7bf715c9e7894622c1d57580d6f32465cec1a088a8535e06be72
#. default-sha256: 6b1c88af38ccc8703af9c7cc258f0ed908b02e194cc1ca0657e7ff466f9a43b8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A91022C2_DDC8_404F_9E06_8CCEBACC812E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Haha... ⟪k:1⟫hahahaha... ⟪k:2⟫heehee!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫はは……、⟪k:1⟫……はははは……、⟪k:2⟫……ひひ……！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_63E11C4C_470B_45C4_BDF5_9D1910BA3315
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d98f349c242a9d59387f3edc2722acd98f062ace08f9112a61e20089706b071
#. default-sha256: 0fa9ac2d9dafe86cd2767645fbb7abc46804bf1531cd686680b49534c32efa95
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_63E11C4C_470B_45C4_BDF5_9D1910BA3315"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫More... ⟪k:1⟫I need more...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I need moooooooooooore!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫足りない……、⟪k:1⟫まだ足りない……、⟪k:2⟫足りなァァァァい……！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_38158AE4_64C6_491B_98D3_B0BE5DA55015
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ee652b78e2e37e4e560cf7d13b69c0e8432a32825cf2b71d197c5e404d3c922
#. default-sha256: ccc345ec3e151ef7b4c98b47ed178fa97956e2ede1738eeb00674e54ee0761e1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_38158AE4_64C6_491B_98D3_B0BE5DA55015"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But she said nothing, simply removing my shackles as commanded."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その娘は、⟪k:1⟫何も言わずに俺の枷を外したよ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_707AA80E_C68A_4C08_8E5F_B7EA77E984E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a80790ed991e36eaaf591144f6f6da87f3082eb1142d90cb99fcfbc2117a25c
#. default-sha256: 9e84330679764960365cdfee7957f8315b4529fd90396b3da7b8a84908d88d02
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_707AA80E_C68A_4C08_8E5F_B7EA77E984E7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫We can have our lives back!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……平和な暮らしを取り戻せる……！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2F5D64A_E594_4284_9082_612E7FE2398A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3e6c0e26f99a950192bd00598ce7e8a54010ed168b523b57403afc7b32f8369
#. default-sha256: 2e43e04a8995811ed3c33b8116eceb9906d9aef663c825891bcc4bea58f7ce0d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D2F5D64A_E594_4284_9082_612E7FE2398A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Undo our shackles, please!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうか……我々の枷も早く！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_64824487_E115_4F4F_BFD9_18DCE692F95E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abf6b936821fbf86dfa8b9b5ffd6c3f6e70766525fcd86d45962e0fa08c283a0
#. default-sha256: 4809d72e3b7e1fdd2d035962613482817340162b498807cccbe9da75ca90dd38
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_64824487_E115_4F4F_BFD9_18DCE692F95E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...What?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………え？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E0FF7BD7_1173_4629_BCC6_D320C1A7BDDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
